Package: dataplane
Title: Data Specification, Parquet Metadata, and Transfer Utilities
Version: 1.0.3
Authors@R: 
    person("Jordan", "Clark", email = "jordanjclark50@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Defines tabular data specifications, validates and attaches units,
    encodes numeric fields, and reads or writes metadata in 'Parquet' files
    using 'Apache Arrow'. Additional utilities support 'GeoParquet' metadata,
    Amazon S3 and Synapse transfers, moving averages, and optional lossless
    'Parquet' encoding through an isolated 'PyArrow' environment.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://jclark50.github.io/dataplane/, https://github.com/jclark50/dataplane
